Third-party pictograms in assets/icons/

The MIT license above covers the code of Maintenance Monitor. Some device
pictograms come from other Homey apps and remain the property of their makers:

- pet_fountain.svg, pet_feeder.svg: from the Sure Petcare Homey app
  (github.com/koktaildotcom/com.sure-petcare), MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2019 koktaildotcom. SureFeed and Felaqua are trademarks of Sure Petcare.
- litter_box.svg: from the Whisker Homey app by Automated Pet Care Products, LLC.
  Litter-Robot is a trademark of Automated Pet Care Products, LLC.
- chicken_coop.svg: from the Omlet Smart Homey app by Bouke Regnerus.
  Omlet is a trademark of Omlet Ltd.
- water_softener.svg: from the AquaCell Homey app by Sander Jacobsen.
- house.svg: drawn for this app.
- All other pictograms: Homey device icons by Athom B.V.
